<tr>
<th>  RespectHoldPosition
</th>
<td align="center"> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bool%20%282da%20type%29" title="Bool (2da type)"> bool </a>
</td>
<td>  This should be set to true if the creature respects the "Hold Position" option the users can set on party members. (If this is true for an action, that action can be discarded by the game because movement on that creature is disabled).
